  "sbi_operational_rails_conclusion": [
    "SBI Remit's 2021/2023 Philippines, Vietnam and Indonesia corridors are the strongest verified SBI-linked live XRP bridge-asset use case in this research; SBI VC Trade sends XRP in real time and Tranglo pays out local fiat. Volume is undisclosed.",
    "SBI Remit's JPY 2.5T cumulative remittance turnover is across all corridors and rails, not an XRP volume metric. Nium and Cambodia DLT rails are separate and should not be attributed to XRP without evidence.",
    "SBI Ripple Asia's XRPL token issuance platform is a concrete regulated infrastructure milestone, but issued prepaid tokens and tokenized deposits are not automatically XRP bridge demand.",
    "SBI START Bond is a JPY debt security token on ibet for Fin. Its XRP subscription reward is a loyalty incentive; the coupon and principal are JPY.",
    "SBI VC Trade's RLUSD deposits/withdrawals were Ethereum-only at launch, so this distribution channel is not an XRPL RLUSD rail.",
    "SBI Digital Finance, SBI Digital Markets, SBI Ripple Asia and SBI VC Trade are distinct legal/business units and must not be conflated.",
    "Doppler partnerships and TVL are exploratory/self-reported; no independent institutional SBI deposit or live XRP lending volume is established."
